--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LOADED AT RUNTIME (no external network calls)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. Solzinho's UI uses only the OS's built-in emoji font and system UI
font ("Segoe UI"); it does not fetch fonts, icons or scripts from the network.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ORIGINAL MATERIAL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The sun character is the "🌞" emoji rendered by the operating system's own
emoji font, not a bundled image asset. All other visual and audio elements
(the speech bubble, the glow, the breathing-exercise chime) are drawn or
synthesized in code at runtime (CSS/SVG and the Web Audio API) and are
covered by Solzinho's own license.
